@startgantt
title Chronos Technical Roadmap 2026
printscale weekly zoom 2

skinparam gantt {
    BarColor LightBlue
    BarBorderColor Blue
    GroupBackgroundColor LightGray
    GroupBorderColor DimGray
    MilestoneBackgroundColor Black
}

Project starts 2026-01-30

-- Phase 1: Foundation & Core Services (Q1) --
[Repository & Build Setup] as [Init] lasts 3 days
[Init] is colored in YellowGreen
[Domain Modeling & Schema Design] as [Domain] lasts 1 week
[Domain] starts at [Init]'s end
[Domain] is colored in YellowGreen
[REST API Design (OpenAPI)] as [API_Design] lasts 1 week
[API_Design] starts at [Domain]'s end
[API_Design] is colored in YellowGreen
[Core Service Implementation] as [Impl] lasts 2 weeks
[Impl] starts at [API_Design]'s end
[Impl] is colored in Green
[Unit & Integration Strategy] as [Test_Strat] lasts 3 days
[Test_Strat] starts at [Impl]'s end
[Test_Strat] is colored in Green
[CI Pipeline (GitHub Actions)] as [CI] lasts 4 days
[CI] starts at [Test_Strat]'s end
[CI] is colored in CornflowerBlue

-- Phase 2: Advanced Logic & Persistence (Q2) --
[Calculation Engine (Strategy Pattern)] as [Calc_Eng] lasts 3 weeks
[Calc_Eng] starts at [CI]'s end
[Calc_Eng] is colored in LightGoldenRodYellow
[Persistence Layer Optimization (JPA/QueryDSL)] as [JPA_Opt] lasts 2 weeks
[JPA_Opt] starts at [Calc_Eng]'s end
[JPA_Opt] is colored in Wheat
[Risk Analysis Integration (External API)] as [Risk_Int] lasts 3 weeks
[Risk_Int] starts at [JPA_Opt]'s end
[Risk_Int] is colored in Orange
[Asynchronous Processing (RabbitMQ/Kafka)] as [Async] lasts 3 weeks
[Async] starts at [Risk_Int]'s end
[Async] is colored in Orange

-- Phase 3: Scalability & DevOps (Q3) --
[Containerization (Docker Multi-stage)] as [Docker] lasts 1 week
[Docker] starts at [Async]'s end
[Docker] is colored in Magenta
[Orchestration (Kubernetes/Helm)] as [K8s] lasts 3 weeks
[K8s] starts at [Docker]'s end
[K8s] is colored in Magenta
[Observability (Prometheus/Grafana)] as [Obs] lasts 2 weeks
[Obs] starts at [K8s]'s end
[Obs] is colored in Purple
[Distributed Tracing (Jaeger)] as [Trace] lasts 1 week
[Trace] starts at [Obs]'s end
[Trace] is colored in Purple
[Load Testing (Gatling/K6)] as [LoadTest] lasts 2 weeks
[LoadTest] starts at [Trace]'s end
[LoadTest] is colored in Purple

-- Phase 4: Hardening & Release (Q4) --
[Security Hardening (OAuth2/OIDC)] as [Sec] lasts 3 weeks
[Sec] starts at [LoadTest]'s end
[Sec] is colored in Crimson
[API Gateway Config (Gateway/Ingress)] as [Gateway] lasts 2 weeks
[Gateway] starts at [Sec]'s end
[Gateway] is colored in Crimson
[Blue/Green Deployment Strategy] as [Dep_Strat] lasts 2 weeks
[Dep_Strat] starts at [Gateway]'s end
